{"url": "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/graduate/future-students/index.html", "final_url": "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/graduate/future-students/index.html", "status": 200, "method": "http", "fetched": "2026-10-24", "text": "Future Students - Graduate Studies - Western University\nSkip to Content\nPopular Links\nPopular Links\nDirectory\nMail\nOWL Brightspace\nStudent Services\nWebsites A - Z\nEvents\nLibraries\nMaps\nParking\nWesternU\nAbout Us\nAdministration\nBiology Department Plan\nPeople\nFaculty\nStaff\nCross-Appointed, Adjunct, and Part-time Faculty\nPost Doctoral\nGraduate Students\nEmeritus\nUndergraduate\nFuture Students\nCurrent Students\nStudent Life\nStudent Perspectives\nGraduate\nResearch Opportunities\nResources for Biology Graduate Supervisors\nFuture Students\nCurrent Students\nStudent Life\nSOBGS\nResearch\nResearch Clusters\nCurrent Student Research Opportunities\nBiology Facilities\nCollaborative Research\nWeekly Seminars\nCommunity\nBiodiversity Inventory\nContact Us\nPositions Available\nNews and Events\nNews\nArchive\nEvents\nAlumni\nSupport Biology\nAlumni Newsletter\nMENU\nAbout Us\nPeople\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nResearch\nCommunity\nNews and Events\nAlumni\nHome\nGraduate\nFuture Students\nFuture Students\nGraduate Studies in Biology\nThe Biology graduate program is the largest and one of the most dynamic in the faculty. About 50 core and adjunct professors supervise thesis-based Masters and Doctoral student projects. At Western University, our tradition of excellence continues to attract outstanding faculty members, postdoctoral scholars and graduate students from around the world. Our graduate programs inspire a passion for the pursuit of knowledge, foster creativity and innovation, and prepare our graduates for successful and exciting careers.\nCareers After Graduating\nProspective students are strongly encouraged to identify a prospective supervisor prior to applying to the graduate program. In an effort to assist applicants, the Department does its best to maintain a listing of which faculty members are currently interested in recruiting students to their laboratories. While not exhaustive, this list is a good resource. Please feel free to review current graduate opportunities and current faculty research interests. Western students can get some excellent advice about graduate studies here.\nResearch Opportunities\nAdmission Requirements\nHow to Apply\nFinancial Support\n\u00a9 1878 - Western University\nDepartment of Biology\n1151 Richmond Street\nLondon, Ontario, Canada, N6A 3K7\nTel: 519-850-2542\nPrivacy |\nWeb Standards |\nTerms of Use |\nAccessibility\nKey Topics:\nAbout Us\nPeople\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nResearch\nCommunity\nNews and Events\nAlumni\nPopular Resources:\nBiology Administration\nFaculty of Science\nOWL\nMy Human Resources", "links": [["Skip to Content", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/graduate/future-students/index.html#skip"], ["", "https://www.uwo.ca/sci/"], ["About Us", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/about_us/index.html"], ["Administration", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/administration/index.html"], ["Biology Department Plan", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/about_us/Biology%20Department%20Plan%20parts%201-5.pdf"], ["People", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/people/index.html"], ["Faculty", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/people/faculty.html"], ["Staff", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/people/staff.html"], ["Cross-Appointed, Adjunct, and Part-time Faculty", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/people/crossappointed-adjunct-and-sessional-faculty.html"], ["Post Doctoral", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/people/post-doctoral.html"], ["Graduate Students", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/people/graduate-students.html"], ["Emeritus", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/people/emeritus.html"], ["Undergraduate", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/undergraduate/index.html"], ["Future Students", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/undergraduate/future-students/index.html"], ["Current Students", "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/undergraduate/current-st